      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Shatura ebishate bibiri by'amabaare nk'eby'okubanza; naanye niinyija kubihandiikaho ebigambo ebyabaire biri aha by'okubanza ebi waayatsire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyencakare omu kasheeshe obe oyeteekateekire, oinamukye aha rushozi Sinai, oyeyorekye omu maisho gangye aha mutwe gwarwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatagira omuntu owainamuka naiwe, kandi otaikiriza omuntu weena kureebwa aha rushozi rwona, n'obu gaakuba amasyo g'entaama nari ag'ente kuriira omu maisho gaarwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaashatura ebishate bibiri by'amabaare nk'eby'okubanza, yaimuka kare omu kasheeshe, yainamuka aha rushozi Sinai nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire, aine omu ngaro ebyo bishate byombi by'amabaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaashuumira omu kicu, yaayemererayo nawe, yaaranga eiziina rye YEHOVA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.9.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 9:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 2:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaaraba omu maisho ga Musa, yaaranga naagira ati: MUKAMA, MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'okusaasira n'embabazi, otarahuka kugira ekiniga, oijwire embabazi n'amazima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.32.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 32:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Yoh 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ogirira embabazi abantu enkumi n'enkumi, osaasira okutahikiirira n'okushiisha n'ekibi; otasingisiriza na kakye abaine orubanja; ohoora abaana ahabw'eby'okushiisha bya baishebo, n'abaijukuru baabo okuhitsya aha busingye bwa kashatu n'obwa kana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaarahuka, yainika omutwe ahansi, yaaramya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaagira ati: Ai MUKAMA, mbwenu ku ndaabe naagirirwa embabazi omu maisho gaawe, ninkweshengyereza, MUKAMA, ogyende ahagati yaitu, n'obu turaabe turi eihanga ry'ebitsya bigangaire, osaasire okutahikiirira kwaitu n'ekibi kyaitu, otwakiire tube obuhunguzi bwawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
