        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira ati: Reeba, nindagaana endagaano; omu maisho g'abantu baawe boona ndyakora eby'okutangaaza ebitakakorwaga mu nsi yoona nari omu ihanga ryona; kandi abantu boona, abu orimu, baryareeba eki MUKAMA arikora, ahakuba eki ndikora, kiryaba eky'okutiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogume oyorobere eki ndikukuragiira eri izooba. Reeba, ndyabinga Abaamori omu maisho gaawe, n'Abanyakanaani, Abahiiti, Abaperizi, Abahiivi n'Abayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyerinde, otariragaana endagaano n'abatwire omu nsi ei orikuzamu, ekaba omutego omuriimwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.18.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 18:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kureka musheenye amatambiro gaabo, muhigure enyomyo zaabo, mutemagure na Ashera zaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 4:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 14:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " (Mumanye ngu timuriramya Ruhanga ondiijo weena; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA, ou eiziina rye ririkwetwa Ow'eihato, ni Ruhanga ow'eihato.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.6.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 6:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Otariragaana endagaano n'abatwire omuri egyo nsi; ahakuba ku barikurata baaruhanga baabo nk'abarikuraaya, baabatambira ebitambo, nyentsya omwe aharibo akaakweta, orya aha kitambo kye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 25:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " oshwererera batabani baawe bahara baabo, bwanyima bahara baabo bakurata baaruhanga baabo nk'abarikuraaya, bareetera batabani baawe kukurata baaruhanga baabo omu muringo ogwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
